   "text": "1 train · 2 ship the checkpoint to each Region · 3 load onto the fleet · 4 your app calls Sydney · 5 tokens stream back · 6 logs and billing stay in your account.\nException: Mythos-class models (e.g. Fable 5) share prompts and outputs with Anthropic for 30 days (see C7a).",
